+# Offscript Editorial
+
+> An asynchronous executive narrative studio turning leaders' spoken thinking into clear, voice-faithful editorial assets.
+
+## What Offscript does
+- Converts podcasts, keynotes, panels, town halls, calls, and voice notes into executive memos and thought leadership.
+- Works asynchronously; no content interviews or recurring Zoom meetings are required.
+- Provides human editorial oversight, voice-first writing, and defined scopes.
+
+## Services
+- Cadence Calibration Test: $250 one-time; 3 memos and a Spoken Cadence Fingerprint.
+- On-Demand Event Sprint: $950 one-time; 5 executive memos and an Event Narrative Brief.
+- Executive Narrative Desk: $3,500/month; 12 executive posts and one 800–1,200-word flagship essay.
+- Fixed-scope commissions have a 48-hour delivery target after payment and usable source material are received; confirm scope and terms before engagement.
+
+## Official pages
+- Homepage: https://offscripteditorial.com/
+- Terms: https://offscripteditorial.com/terms
+- Contact: mailto:inquiry@offscripteditorial.com
